    {
      "subId": "4003107",
      "subQuestName": "Save the small animals",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4003108",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Ryuuji",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400310801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400310801": {
            "id": "400310801",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Thank you very much. You've been a big help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400310802"
            ]
          },
          "400310802": {
            "id": "400310802",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Right? {NICKNAME}'s the strongest there is!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400310803"
            ]
          },
          "400310803": {
            "id": "400310803",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Does the number of animals tally up now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400310804"
            ]
          },
          "400310804": {
            "id": "400310804",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "One moment... Huh. There's still some missing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400310805"
            ]
          },
          "400310805": {
            "id": "400310805",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? But how...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400310806"
            ]
          },
          "400310806": {
            "id": "400310806",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "I'd hardly consider this a loss. We weren't taken out by our Black Shadow, and we managed to get a number of animals back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400310807"
            ]
          },
          "400310807": {
            "id": "400310807",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "As such, our investigation's making progress. We're just out of leads for the time being.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400310808"
            ]
          },
          "400310808": {
            "id": "400310808",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Let me tell you what. I'll keep investigating. You keep doing what you usually do for a while... Let's meet up at Bantan Sango Detective Agency once something new comes up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400310809"
            ]
          },
          "400310809": {
            "id": "400310809",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, it's not as if we've got better options."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4003151",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400315101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400315101": {
            "id": "400315101",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "#Do you need anything, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400315103",
              "400315108",
              "400315111"
            ]
          },
          "400315103": {
            "id": "400315103",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Ah, that. Well, I was originally going to have Ryuuji use it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400315104"
            ]
          },
          "400315104": {
            "id": "400315104",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "It's not as if our work isn't dangerous, you know? Ryuuji's been injured several times before. So I was thinking — how do I extend the range at which we can capture criminals?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400315105"
            ]
          },
          "400315105": {
            "id": "400315105",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "I read a lot of old books and wound up designing this net, even commissioning a friend to construct it. In the end, however, \"catching small animals\" was as far as we got...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400315106"
            ]
          },
          "400315106": {
            "id": "400315106",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "But whatever the case, it's come to good use in your hands, so that's a plus."
          },
          "400315108": {
            "id": "400315108",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Ooh, so you're curious about that, huh? Well, here's what happened...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400315109"
            ]
          },
          "400315109": {
            "id": "400315109",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "...Actually, you know what? Never mind. If Ryuuji's that opposed to me discussing that matter, I'll refrain."
          },
          "400315111": {
            "id": "400315111",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Please do. Stay safe!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4003152",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400315201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400315201": {
            "id": "400315201",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Leave what comes after the animals are found to me. I will take them home as soon as possible.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400315203",
              "400315208",
              "400315211"
            ]
          },
          "400315203": {
            "id": "400315203",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "I've heard tell of a secret organization that trains ninken, or ninja dogs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400315204"
            ]
          },
          "400315204": {
            "id": "400315204",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "They say that one such dog, code-named Inujin, destroyed countless monsters that threatened Inazuma in the shadows...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400315205"
            ]
          },
          "400315205": {
            "id": "400315205",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "...Of course, this is just a legend. Still, I wonder if this Black Shadow could be the legendary ninken...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400315206"
            ]
          },
          "400315206": {
            "id": "400315206",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Whatever. I shouldn't make excuses for my defeat..."
          },
          "400315208": {
            "id": "400315208",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "I was unable to save the animals while evading its case, but while I was casing the joint, I did find the time to place a few smoke dispensers nearby.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400315209"
            ]
          },
          "400315209": {
            "id": "400315209",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "If you activate these mechanisms, should be able to temporarily divert its attention. I hope that they will help."
          },
          "400315211": {
            "id": "400315211",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Good, thank you. I will stand guard here."
          }
        }
